        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_02",
      "hash64": "128CFA72A6CCF9DC",
      "text": "Bah ! Pourquoi tu viens m’parler, alors ?\\nArrête de m’faire poireauter et battons-nous ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_03",
      "hash64": "128CFB72A6CCFB8F",
      "text": "Parfait !\\nToi aussi, t’es prêt, Dogrino ?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_04",
      "hash64": "128CF872A6CCF676",
      "text": "Grouaouaf !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_05",
      "hash64": "128CF972A6CCF829",
      "text": "Hé hé !\\nIl dit qu’il est prêt à en découdre ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "legend_0120_select_01",
      "hash64": "5ACB8C3B6D658065",
      "text": "Tu vas envoyer Dogrino au combat ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "legend_0120_select_02",
      "hash64": "5ACB893B6D657B4C",
      "text": "Tu es sûr que ça va aller ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_06",
      "hash64": "128CF672A6CCF310",
      "text": "Ouais, j’comprends pourquoi t’es inqui[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]etète\\npour lui...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_07",
      "hash64": "128CF772A6CCF4C3",
      "text": "Mais j’t’assure qu’il est en pleine forme !\\nC’est comme s’il avait jamais été malade ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_08",
      "hash64": "128D0472A6CD0ADA",
      "text": "Et il réclame qu’une chose : se battre contre toi.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_09",
      "hash64": "128D0572A6CD0C8D",
      "text": "Tu sais, à la base, il adore les combats... même\\ns’il a jamais fait le poids contre la déléguée.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_10",
      "hash64": "12900272A6CF3D4B",
      "text": "Bref, t’as pas à t’inquiéter ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_11",
      "hash64": "12900172A6CF3B98",
      "text": "Maintenant que les épices nous ont requinqués,\\nc’est l’retour du duo de choc ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_12",
      "hash64": "12900472A6CF40B1",
      "text": "Et tu vas goûter à notre force ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_13",
      "hash64": "12900372A6CF3EFE",
      "text": "Quelle force... ! J’comprends mieux comment t’as\\nréussi à vaincre tous ces Dominants, maintenant ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_14",
      "hash64": "12900672A6CF4417",
      "text": "Enfin, j’pense qu’il va quand même nous falloir\\nde l’aide si on veut aller dans la Zone Zéro ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_15",
      "hash64": "12900572A6CF4264",
      "text": "Là-bas, les Pokémon, ils rigolent pas.\\nEt on y trouve plein de machines bizarres...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16",
      "hash64": "12900872A6CF477D",
      "text": "L’idéal serait de recruter deux personnes en plus.\\c\\nQuelqu’un de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]fort en combat[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]qui a déjà[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]atteint le rang Maître[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], et quelqu’un qui [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]connaît[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]la technologie sur le bout des doigts[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
