    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16a",
      "hash64": "5A0576D17235D494",
      "text": "La déléguée ?\\c\\nMais oui ! Super idée !\\nY a aucun Pokémon qui lui résiste, à elle ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16b",
      "hash64": "5A0579D17235D9AD",
      "text": "Pania, la Big Boss de la Team Star ?\\nLa reine du piratage ?\\c\\nT’es ami[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e avec elle ?\\nT’as de drôles de fréquentations...\\r\\nMais elle fera sûrement l’affaire ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16c",
      "hash64": "5A0578D17235D7FA",
      "text": "La déléguée...\\c\\nC’est pas une mauvaise idée, mais j’pense\\nqu’elle bougera pas le p’tit doigt tant que\\r\\nt’auras pas atteint le rang Maître, toi aussi.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_16d",
      "hash64": "5A0573D17235CF7B",
      "text": "Pania ? Je la connais pas bien...\\c\\nMais j’suis pas sûr qu’elle accepterait de nous\\ndonner un coup de main comme ça...\\c\\nElle nous doit rien, après tout... Faudrait d’abord\\napprendre à mieux la connaître, je pense.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 216,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_17a",
      "hash64": "5A0252D172336191",
      "text": "Bref, essayons de former une équipe.\\nOn se tient au jus ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_18a",
      "hash64": "59D662D1720E41D6",
      "text": "De ton côté, va voir si quelqu’un d’autre\\npeut nous rejoindre ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_17b",
      "hash64": "5A024FD172335C78",
      "text": "Hein ? T’as déjà trouvé des compagnons pour\\nnotre équipe ?! Tu gères ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "legend_0120_friend_18b",
      "hash64": "59D661D1720E4023",
      "text": "Excellent ! J’vais les contacter, alors.\\c\\nOn se retrouve au Portail Zéro !\\nC’est une structure près du cratère !\\c\\nT’inquiète, je t’envoie les coordonnées.\\nAlors grouille-toi ![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
